WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:04.591
TextHalo. Listen, dictate, and get a little help.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:11.472
Select a passage, then press your shortcut. Hear it read aloud, and stop whenever you like.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:18.759
Hold your dictation shortcut and speak. Release to put your words into the current app, or copy them.

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:25.576
Need a clearer draft? Select the text, hold your Assistant shortcut, and ask for an edit.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:29.800
Your words. Your way. TextHalo for Mac.
